ve impact, but RIY is a growth-rate equivalent rather than an all-in-one monetary or percentage total. The illustration and the charge schedule exist but are not explicitly reconciled or cross-referenced in a way that makes the complete cumulative burden transparent to the reader. The Effect of Switching figures represent the net outcome but do not itemise which costs drive the reduction.","citations":[{"passageId":"P4","source":"Suitability Report Test 1.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"Reduction in yield [1] 0.3% ... Reduction in yield [1] 2.2% ... This is a reduction in the growth rate of 2.1% . All charges could reduce this pension fund from £129,000.00 to £115,000.00"},{"passageId":"P2","source":"Illustration - new.md","category":"H","quote":"Product and Investment charges could reduce this pension fund from £129,000.00 to £126,000.00 - this is the same as reducing the investment growth after inflation from 2.9% to 2.5% . This is a reduction in the growth rate of 0.4%. All charges could reduce this pension fund from £129,000.00 to £115,000.00 - this is the same as reducing the investment growth after inflation from 2.9% to 0.8%. This is a reduction in the growth rate of 2.1% ."},{"passageId":"P7","source":"Suitability Report Test 1.md","category":"I_RecommendationsAndAdvice","quote":"Platform 0.21% ... Investment Management 0.22% ... Total Charge 0.44%"},{"passageId":"P10","source":"Illustration - new.md","category":"H","quote":"Initial Adviser Charge 3.00% which equals £3,305.55 from the cash transfer payments into your pension. Ongoing Adviser Charge 1.00% of the value of your Aviva pension fund each year."}],"severity":"Moderate","outcome":"PotentialConcern"}

