Where You've instructed Us to pay a DIM Charge, then as soon as We take the money from Your Cash Account to pay Your DIM, this is no longer Your money and it becomes due and payable by Us to Your DIM. We will only facilitate payment of these charges once You have sufficient cleared cash in Your Cash Account.
