To meet regulatory requirements or industry guidance or best practice
To make this agreement easier to understand or fairer, or to correct mistakes.
To reflect changes in market practice or conditions
To reflect the way that our advisory services are used and ensure that the costs of those advisory services are allocated fairly among our clients.
