## IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT OUR INVESTMENT, PENSION AND PROTECTION ADVICE SERVICES
TFAS
## WHO ARE WE AND WHAT DO WE DO?
TFAS Wealth Limited believe that when people want access to expert and impartial advice on their options for investment, they want it to be a friendly and efficient service. We take enormous pride in being able to welcome our clients to our easy and straightforward service delivering what they want and need.
As an independent provider of financial advice, we do not act on behalf of any product provider, bank or insurance company so have only our clients' best interests at heart.
Any advice or recommendation that we offer you will be based on your defined and agreed objectives, the level of risk you are willing and able to take and any restrictions that you wish to place on the type of investments, markets or products you would be willing to consider. We will send you a suitability report, which confirms all of these points. Full details of the plans we recommend will also be provided to you before arranging your solution.
